SUMMARY:The Only Living Pickpocket in New York
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:45pm\, 5:45pm\, 7:45pm\nHarry Lehman (John Turturro) i
 s an aging pickpocket who plies his trade with ever-diminishing returns in
  a drastically changed New York. Wallets stuffed with cash have been repla
 ced by easily cancelled credit cards\, and Harry struggles to make ends me
 et as he cares for his disabled wife\, Rosie. When he unwittingly purloins
  and fences a valuable USB stick\, Harry finds himself in a race against t
 ime to return the loot or face the rage of a vengeful crime family.\nhttps
 ://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-only-living-pickpocket-in-new-york\n
 From Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-only-living-pickpocket-in-ne
 w-york
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ccfdf37ac7b71d94a69785e659a7bb0fc9c3a9ce@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261031T193113Z
DTSTART:20261031T200000Z
DTEND:20261031T220000Z
SUMMARY:Wildwood
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4pm\, 7pm\nWildwood is a handcrafted epic fantasy that t
 ransports audiences into a secret\, dangerously alive world. A girl’s de
 sperate quest to save her baby brother unfolds into a spectacular\, high-s
 takes adventure through a forbidden forest full of enchanted creatures\, e
 ndearing allies\, and formidable adversaries—where an entire hidden real
 m hangs in the balance. In an era of automation\, LAIKA delivers its most 
 ambitious and globally accessible film yet—a bold fusion of human-crafte
 d artistry and cinematic storytelling from the makers of Coraline.\nhttps:
 //www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/wildwood\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pu
 shpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/wildwood
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
