DTSTART:20261031T200000Z
DTEND:20261031T220000Z
SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4pm\, 6:30pm\nThirty-four days before she’s sent to pr
 ison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skeptic
 al film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate portra
 it of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into th
 e abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenhei
 m comes You Can See Everything.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/yo
 u-can-see-everything\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/you-can-see-everything
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:96eb3265a062043530b3201b63b7ea371fbcd1fb@pushpin.city
