DTEND:20261104T230000Z
SUMMARY:Wildwood
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4pm\, 7pm\nWildwood is a handcrafted epic fantasy that t
 ransports audiences into a secret\, dangerously alive world. A girl’s de
 sperate quest to save her baby brother unfolds into a spectacular\, high-s
 takes adventure through a forbidden forest full of enchanted creatures\, e
 ndearing allies\, and formidable adversaries—where an entire hidden real
 m hangs in the balance. In an era of automation\, LAIKA delivers its most 
 ambitious and globally accessible film yet—a bold fusion of human-crafte
 d artistry and cinematic storytelling from the makers of Coraline.\nhttps:
 //www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/wildwood\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pu
 shpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/wildwood
END:VEVENT
