SUMMARY:Ty Burr's Film Club: Seven Samurai
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:This three-hour ride from Akira Kurosawa seamlessly weaves phil
 osophy and entertainment\, delicate human emotions\, and relentless action
 \, into a rich\, evocative\, and unforgettable tale of courage and hope.\n
 https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/ty-burrs-film-club-seven-samurai\nF
 rom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
