DTEND:20261119T013000Z
SUMMARY:Riverdogs & The Same River Twice
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:In 1978 Robb Moss filmed a group of friends\, young river guide
 s\, on a 35-day rafting trip through the Grand Canyon\, and he has kept fi
 lming them ever since.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-same-ri
 ver-twice-riverdogs-with-filmmaker-ro\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpi
 n.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/the-same-river-twice-riverdogs-w
 ith-filmmaker-ro
